                "text": "The weather in San Francisco is currently around 72°F (22°C) and windy. Here are some recommendations for what to wear:\n\n1. **Light Layering**: A light sweater or long-sleeve shirt is ideal since temperatures can change, especially in the evening.\n2. **Windbreaker or Light Jacket**: To protect against the wind, a windbreaker will keep you comfortable.\n3. **Comfortable Pants**: Lightweight pants or jeans are a good option.\n4. **Footwear**: Comfortable shoes for walking are a must, especially if you plan to explore the city.\n5. **Accessories**: Consider a scarf or hat if you feel the chill from the wind.\n\nEnjoy your time in San Francisco!"
